{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55831","headline":"临寂示漳州刺史陈文颢偈（题拟） · 玄应","name":"临寂示漳州刺史陈文颢偈（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今年六十六，世寿有延促。\n无生火炽然，有爲薪不续。\n出谷与归源，一时俱备足。\n（《小传》卷二十四、《五灯会元》卷八。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"玄应","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55831.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55831","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}